   "about": {
    "en": "How long the way takes by the SRD travel rules: the pace and what it means, the terrain (in the 2024 rules it limits the pace and gives the encounter distance and DCs), good roads, long days with Constitution saves, and ships by their speed. The rules follow the adventure’s edition.",
